KING – DUST AND BLOOD” and “SCP-001-

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:31.559
The Scarlet King - Darth Vader Begs For Mercy”
for more of the multiverse’s most monstrous

00:20:31.559 --> 00:20:31.820
monarch!

